OL,3,GNEWSAPartially sighted gardener seeks
OL,4,Ato inspire others
OL,5,
OL,6,FA partially sighted gardener is hoping
OL,7,Fto inspire and connect with other
OL,8,Fpeople by sharing his experiences
OL,9,Fthrough videos on social media.
OL,11,FJohn Henry, 67, from Guernsey lost part
OL,12,Fof his sight after developing Ramsay
OL,13,FHunt syndrome, a neurological condition
OL,14,Fwhich affects the body's nervous
OL,15,Fsystem.
OL,17,FHe started the John's Patch YouTube
OL,18,Fchannel after socialising became a
OL,19,Fchallenge and he wanted to connect with
OL,20,Fother people who may struggle to leave
OL,21,Fthe house through disability, mental
OL,22,Fhealth issues or age.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
