OL,3,GNEWSAPartially sighted gardener seeks
OL,4,Ato inspire others
OL,5,
OL,6,FHenry said he would see his channel as
OL,7,Fa success if he could inspire anyone in
OL,8,Fa similar situation to "give it a go"
OL,9,Fand get outside or socialise once
OL,10,Fagain.
